Subject: Cantor FPGA Lowering Profile Plan

@ [plan_uuid] 5c9a7cc4-d3fa-4b4e-a05d-8cb4d846c04f
@ [requirement_set] CFLP-001 through CFLP-024

& [CurrentPlan] is contract_only
  + refine and sign eligibility, interface, evidence, admission, and correspondence rules
  + stop before choosing a target or writing hardware

& [FutureEvidencePlan] remains blocked pending software proof and profiling
  + CFLP-E01 profile deterministic software interpreter and identify candidate stable kernels
  + CFLP-E02 compare CPU optimization, SIMD, GPU, database or graph indexes, and FPGA alternatives
  + CFLP-E03 preserve a target-specific source addendum naming board, device, toolchain, interfaces, constraints, security, and acceptance
  + CFLP-E04 select interpreter or native realization and emit target-specific canonical authority
  + CFLP-E05 build software golden model and hardware simulation correspondence fixtures
  + CFLP-E06 only then consider synthesis, timing, resource, bitstream, driver, loading, rollback, and device proof

& [StopRules] are hard
  + no measured kernel means no target-specific hardware campaign
  + no software semantic reference means no hardware correspondence claim
  + no target-specific SJS signature means no HDL, HLS, synthesis, bitstream, purchase, or device loading
